<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia's QTC to offer A$100 mln 2007 stock.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia's QTC to offer A$100 mln 2007 stock.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Queensland Treasury Corporation (QTC) said it will be offering A$100 million of 8.0 percent September 2007 stock at a tender at 10.30 am Sydney time (2330 GMT).</p>
<p>Result of the tender should be known shortly afterwards.</p>
<p>QTC is the borrowing arm of the state of Queensland.</p>
<p>--Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
